      "message": "fix(post): pin every plasma refusal; a pending kerf comp never outlives its torch span (#679 review)\n\nThe six tormach-plasma.cps refusals no test reached (dark, comp-open,\ncomparc, nofeed, plane, wear) each get a refused(...) case in\nplasma_post_refusals; deleting any one now fails the suite.\n\nA G41.1/G42.1 still pending when the torch goes out (COMP read, no lit\nstraight G1 carried it) is refused by name (\"comp-pending\") and the\nword is dropped at TORCH OFF, so it can never land on the next\ncontour's first G1. Pinned by\na_pending_kerf_engage_never_outlives_its_torch_span.\n\nTORCH SMALL's range error now names the factor's range, (0, 1], and\nthe SMALL word's x1000 scale; pinned by\na_small_hole_factor_out_of_range_names_the_factor_range.\n\nGoldens unchanged.\n\nRefs #671\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
